# Email verification (Brevo HTTPS API)
#
# Registration OTP codes and collaborator invitation emails are sent
# through Brevo's REST API over HTTPS (port 443). This works on Render's
# Free tier, which blocks outbound SMTP ports (25/465/587) but allows
# normal HTTPS requests.
#
# Unlike most providers, Brevo lets you send to real recipients using a
# single VERIFIED SENDER EMAIL ADDRESS -- you do NOT need to own a domain.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create a free Brevo account: https://www.brevo.com
#   2. Go to Senders, Domains & Dedicated IPs -> Senders -> Add a sender,
#      enter the email address you want to send from (e.g. your Gmail
#      address), and click the verification link Brevo emails you.
#   3. Go to SMTP & API -> API Keys -> Generate a new API key.
#   4. Put that key in EMAIL_API_KEY below, and the verified address in
#      EMAIL_FROM (matching the exact address you verified).
#
# Free tier: 300 emails/day, no credit card required.
EMAIL_FROM=FamilyRoots <your-verified-sender@gmail.com>
EMAIL_API_KEY=your-brevo-api-key

EMAIL_VERIFICATION_CODE_EXPIRES_MINUTES=10
